{"unit_id":"webkubor__dsh-env-inspector#card-zh","repo":"webkubor/dsh-env-inspector","commit":"361039aa27a87efbe62af6834a262250f89ef934","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-env-inspector 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的本机环境诊断面板，通过宿主路由采集系统概况、CLI 与 AI 工具版本、语言运行时、模型密钥配置状态、已安装插件、网络接口和监听端口。它提供电脑环境独立页面与输入框快捷徽章，可查看端口进程、筛选动态高位端口，并在用户确认后释放所选端口；也能复制诊断摘要。公网出口 IP 仅在用户点击查询时请求 api.ipify.org。适合需要快速盘点开发环境或定位端口占用的 DSH 用户；无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:483-524","lib/client.js:1182-1206","lib/client.js:875-881"]}
{"unit_id":"webkubor__dsh-env-inspector#card-en","repo":"webkubor/dsh-env-inspector","commit":"361039aa27a87efbe62af6834a262250f89ef934","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-env-inspector adds a DSH web dashboard for local system details, developer and AI tools, runtimes, configured key presence, plugins, network interfaces, and listening ports. It supports port review and user-confirmed release. Public IP lookup runs on click. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:483-524","lib/client.js:1182-1206","lib/client.js:875-881"]}
