{"unit_id":"webkubor__dsh-env-inspector#feature-1","repo":"webkubor/dsh-env-inspector","commit":"361039aa27a87efbe62af6834a262250f89ef934","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-env-inspector 的功能「监听端口概览」：读取本机 TCP 监听端口及关联进程，标记通配地址，并按开发、核心、服务和动态端口分类；面板可展开动态端口列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:370-418","lib/client.js:571-650"]}
